{"version":1,"content":"<p>蘋果（Apple）首款摺機iPhone Duo今日（23日）在香港開售，電子平台組記者上午到旺角先達廣場，廣場外已大排長龍，不少人等候入內放售手機，場內一度擠得水泄不通。</p><p>（採訪、拍攝：談浩民）</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T13:04:44.161301+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":97,"images":0,"source":"明報 消閒","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T10:17:17+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T22:18:05.662738+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T12:58:11.860610+00:00","content_hash":"2178f96df1f483ffd573a50835bf0ddb093c46aa8ca8b5b43dcfbde2aee73567","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}